      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHREWD (1) had won four starts on end leading into last time when strongly fancied but could only manage third (31.17) at this track. Can measure up this time. LITTLE LOCKETT (5) was prominent early from the tricky draw and did a fair job to be beaten one length into second (34.92) at this track in a Grade 5/6 over 595m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Racing well and deserves a win. TEXAS BANDIT (8) has a strong overall record having eight wins and 13 places from 28 starts including a last start success (30.77) over 530m at this track. Tends to go well on this box draw. Will go close here with a clear run. GINA GULLA (4) was in the money last time at this track (30.98) in a OPEN, finishing a 6 length second. Has five wins already from this draw.",
